---
title: Vegan Burritos
description: Pack these vegan wraps with vegetables, rice and chipotle black beans to make a delicious and nutritious lunch.
image: https://images.immediate.co.uk/production/volatile/sites/30/2020/08/burrito-bf165ae.jpg?resize=440,400
servings: 4
time required: 40 minutes
prep time: 10 minutes
course: Dinner, Lunch, Supper
cook time: 30 minutes
tags: Black beans, Burritos, Chipotle, Lulu Grimes, Tortillas, Vegan, Vegetarian, Wrap
